claim.claim-text:
the first atomizer (21, 21a, 21b) comprises a first airflow channel (Q1) transmitting the aerosol generated by the first atomizer (21, 21a, 21b); the second atomizer (22, 22b) comprises a second airflow channel (Q2) transmitting the aerosol generated by the second atomizer (22, 22b);
the aerosol generating system further comprises a third airflow channel (Q3) for communicating the first airflow channel (Q1) and the second airflow channel (Q2);
the first sensing surface (271) is directly or indirectly communicated with the outside atmosphere;
the second sensing surface (272) is communicated with the third airflow channel (Q3) for sensing airflow change in the third airflow channel (Q3).

the aerosol generating device (20) is movable with respect to the power supply device (10) and has a first position and a second position with respect to the power supply device (10);
the first atomizer (21, 21a, 21b) is non-conductively connected to the power supply device (10) in the second position; and/or,
the second atomizer (22, 22b) is non-conductively connected to the power supply device (10) in the first position.

the aerosol generating device (20) is movable with respect to the power supply device (10) and has a first position and a second position with respect to the power supply device (10);
the first atomizer (21, 21a, 21b) is conductively connected to the power supply device (10) in the first position; and/or,
the second atomizer (22, 22b) is conductively connected to the power supply device (10) in the second position.

a position detecting component (40) for detecting whether the aerosol generating device (20) is in the first position or in the second position, and
a controller (29);
wherein the controller (29) is configured to control the power supply device (10) to output power to the first atomizer (21, 21a, 21b) or the second atomizer (22, 22b) according to the position of the aerosol generating device (20) detected by the position detecting component (40).

the position detecting component (40) comprises a conductive connector (41) provided on the aerosol generating device (20) and a first contact (121) provided on the power supply device (10);
the conductive connector (41) is conductively connectable to the first contact (121) in one of the first position or the second position;
the position detecting component (40) further comprises a detection circuit (43) for detecting whether the conductive connector (41) is conductively connected to the first contact (121).
